msgid ""
"Destroyer III(Simian):   Hull:100   Shield:110,70   Size:200   Repair "
"Crew:3   Cargo:7   R.Strength:25\n"
"Default advanced engine:Jump (2U - 20U)   Speeds: Impulse:60   Spin:8   "
"Accelerate:15   C.Maneuver: Boost:450 Strafe:150\n"
"Beam:1 Turreted Speed:0.2\n"
